<!-- Channel sidebar pin + drag-and-drop (design prototype, TV-538): pick up a row —
     in Pinned a slot placeholder marks where it lands (the tab pattern);
     over Recent the whole section is the placeholder, since date order
     fixes the slot. Selection is on pointer up, not press. Menu Pin
     appends to the pinned group; Unpin returns to the date slot. -->

